{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takeshi Kuranari, an ordinary college student, visits the underwater theme park LeMU. An accident occurs, trapping Takeshi and 6 other individuals inside LeMU, 51 meters below the surface. With no hope of rescue, Takeshi explores LeMU along with the mysterious girl Tsugumi and part-time employee You, searching for a way to escape to the surface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A theme park of dreams and hopes sunk in the depths of the mysterious blue ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can dreams and hopes still be found there? Or is there some other mystery lurking?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcoming one crisis after another, they search for a way to escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A masterpiece written by Kotaro Uchikoshi comes to Steam, 22 years after the initial Japanese release!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the story via point-and-click visual novel style gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will affect the outcome of the story with multiple scenarios and endings.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392500/183d08d2f77a87258d08228d25db68dccbe88916.jpg"},{"name":"A Cruel Wandering","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392500/9f5d7dee4149fd4995a104d9122035a211bb457e.jpg"},{"name":"A Farewell Embrace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392500/3af98fd13d057b32cbdb895fa187aefbb7c55f24.jpg"},{"name":"A Profound Confession","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392500/1acbf21b63bc94771b28efec956c9c363dcf62c1.jpg"},{"name":"A Journey of Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2392500/780a9fb6c88620337a6